```text
RCCL Tests may be built with MPI to run multiple processes and multiple nodes.
The total number of ranks is the product of MPI processes and GPUs selected per
process. Multi-node examples use an MPI host list/hostfile; one process per GPU
is recommended for representative distributed testing. The suite reports
collective correctness and algorithm/bus bandwidth across message sizes.

The README does not name Strix Halo, USB4, Thunderbolt, or Ethernet-over-USB4 as
a validated topology.
```
